DATABASE:
Contains information from CoMuNeLab C.ELEGANS MULTIPLEX CONNECTOME,
https://github.com/CoMuNeLab/C-elegans-Multiplex-Connectome,
made available under Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.
The reindexed, deduplicated database in data/connectome.json is also
made available under ODbL 1.0. Individual database contents follow the
upstream Database Contents License (DbCL) 1.0.
Preserve attribution, license notices and access to the derivative database.
The raw data, derivative database and transformation tool are included.
The standalone HTML also provides a machine-readable JSON download.
See licenses/ODbL-1.0.txt, licenses/DbCL-1.0.txt, CREDITS.md and PROVENANCE.md.
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/

